1
00:00:44,570 --> 00:00:45,460
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:46,790
[Episode 21]

3
00:00:46,820 --> 00:00:47,230
[Adapted from Migu's novel
“Unsoiled Starlight” ]

4
00:00:47,250 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Writer: Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:53,480
Did you guys see the news?

6
00:00:53,480 --> 00:00:54,640
Someone posted

7
00:00:54,760 --> 00:00:56,640
that after using
Zhuoyuan Tech's smart home system,

8
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:58,970
they were diagnosed as being hypnotized.

9
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,080
That's unbelievable.

10
00:01:00,080 --> 00:01:00,640
It's so absurd.

11
00:01:00,640 --> 00:01:02,770
How could anyone believe such a thing?

12
00:01:04,599 --> 00:01:05,440
It must be a scam.

13
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:06,320
Technically speaking,

14
00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:07,400
it's not impossible.

15
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:09,200
But what company
would take such a huge risk?

16
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:10,840
Whose product did they install?

17
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:11,640
Tell us so we can avoid it.

18
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:13,640
Do they have persecution paranoia?

19
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:20,480
Tinglan,

20
00:01:21,080 --> 00:01:21,880
did you hear?

21
00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:22,950
Last night,

22
00:01:23,039 --> 00:01:24,720
someone posted on social media,

23
00:01:24,720 --> 00:01:27,000
claiming they were hypnotized
by a smart home system.

24
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:27,760
Now all fingers

25
00:01:27,760 --> 00:01:29,160
are pointed at Zhuoyuan Technology.

26
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:29,760
Looks like

27
00:01:29,870 --> 00:01:31,120
we might have to work overtime

28
00:01:31,120 --> 00:01:32,180
with their PR team.

29
00:01:33,039 --> 00:01:33,640
No way.

30
00:01:34,330 --> 00:01:36,140
Zhuoyuan Tech is such a big group.

31
00:01:36,140 --> 00:01:37,759
Could it be a publicity stunt?

32
00:01:37,759 --> 00:01:38,400
At first,

33
00:01:38,470 --> 00:01:40,400
we thought it was a marketing ploy.

34
00:01:40,479 --> 00:01:41,520
But this morning,

35
00:01:41,640 --> 00:01:44,100
the poster released
a clear medical report.

36
00:01:44,190 --> 00:01:44,800
It seems

37
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:46,050
it's actually true.

38
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:47,800
Things on the internet

39
00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:48,729
are hard to tell.

40
00:01:49,160 --> 00:01:49,970
Let's wait and see.

41
00:01:49,970 --> 00:01:51,229
There might be a twist.

42
00:01:57,750 --> 00:02:00,320
The relationships in the previous case
are quite complex.

43
00:02:00,320 --> 00:02:02,480
Lawyer Zhou, you need to communicate more

44
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,600
and sort it out clearly.

45
00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:04,640
Next,

46
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:06,480
we will draft a legal letter

47
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:07,520
based on the PR content.

48
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:08,919
The third wave of news has been released.

49
00:02:08,919 --> 00:02:10,039
Denying product issues.

50
00:02:10,039 --> 00:02:11,440
Exposing Wen Jian's personal behavior.

51
00:02:10,660 --> 00:02:15,620
[Hongzheng Law Firm]

52
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:12,720
This legal letter...

53
00:02:17,329 --> 00:02:18,200
Mr. Zhuo.

54
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:20,360
Understood.

55
00:02:20,460 --> 00:02:23,310
[Hongzheng Law Firm]

56
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:25,920
Mr. Zhuo means

57
00:02:25,870 --> 00:02:28,660
[Hongzheng Law Firm]

58
00:02:26,040 --> 00:02:26,920
this incident

59
00:02:26,920 --> 00:02:29,450
will be handled
by their internal legal team.

60
00:02:37,480 --> 00:02:38,760
I'm not coming home tonight.

61
00:02:38,760 --> 00:02:39,890
Don't wait up for me.

62
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:41,530
Don't skip your dinner.

63
00:02:42,579 --> 00:02:46,430
[Hongzheng Law Firm]

64
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:52,360
Zhuo Yu'an!

65
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:54,560
We shouldn’t rush

66
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:55,690
a press conference.

67
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:59,200
If it's really a product issue,

68
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:00,120
we should present

69
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:01,580
a convincing data report.

70
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:02,580
Otherwise,

71
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:04,640
it's just slander and false accusations.

72
00:03:04,640 --> 00:03:05,760
And I don't believe

73
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:08,020
you'd ruin your own future like that.

74
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:11,090
This must be a smear campaign
by our competitors.

75
00:03:12,550 --> 00:03:17,840
[Meeting Room]

76
00:03:14,480 --> 00:03:15,560
You know me.

77
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:18,010
I only do things with evidence.

78
00:03:23,090 --> 00:03:26,890
[Zhuoyuan Tech Smart Home System
Press Conference]

79
00:03:28,079 --> 00:03:29,280
Regarding the doubts

80
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:30,640
raised by users today

81
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:31,770
about our products,

82
00:03:32,150 --> 00:03:32,960
I am here

83
00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:34,160
to respond

84
00:03:34,160 --> 00:03:35,690
on behalf of Zhuoyuan Tech.

85
00:03:35,720 --> 00:03:37,780
We've conducted an internal review.

86
00:03:38,140 --> 00:03:38,970
The issues exposed

87
00:03:38,970 --> 00:03:40,079
are true.

88
00:03:40,350 --> 00:03:41,079
This incident

89
00:03:41,079 --> 00:03:43,200
was a personal act of revenge

90
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:45,240
by our CTO, Wen Jian.

91
00:03:46,260 --> 00:03:47,880
The above actions did not involve

92
00:03:47,880 --> 00:03:50,160
-What’s going on?
-the other products and users.

93
00:03:50,160 --> 00:03:51,840
We'll work with Wen Jian to...

94
00:03:50,380 --> 00:03:51,770
[Zhuoyuan Tech Smart Home System
Press Conference]

95
00:03:52,040 --> 00:03:53,600
Are you behind that?

96
00:03:53,920 --> 00:03:55,040
As you can see.

97
00:03:55,600 --> 00:03:56,480
Why?

98
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:57,770
Wen Jian,

99
00:03:58,120 --> 00:03:59,560
why did you do this?

100
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,800
You ruined yourself,

101
00:04:02,240 --> 00:04:03,570
and even ruined Zhuoyuan Tech.

102
00:04:03,570 --> 00:04:04,720
There’s no why.

103
00:04:04,740 --> 00:04:06,080
Zhuoyuan Tech wasn't ruined by me,

104
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:07,080
but by Zhuo Yu'an.

105
00:04:07,160 --> 00:04:08,400
Blame it on his indulgence

106
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:09,600
and indecision.

107
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:16,600
We'll work with the authorities

108
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:18,760
to hand Wen Jian over to the courts

109
00:04:18,760 --> 00:04:21,279
and fully cooperate
with the follow-up investigation.

110
00:04:21,279 --> 00:04:22,600
On behalf of the company,

111
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:23,660
I'd like to offer all our users

112
00:04:23,660 --> 00:04:25,240
our sincerest apologies.

113
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:42,380
But Zhuo Yu'an shouldn't really apologize.

114
00:04:43,320 --> 00:04:44,480
Wen Jian should.

115
00:04:46,470 --> 00:04:50,090
[Inpatient Department]

116
00:04:56,880 --> 00:04:57,960
Are you that free,

117
00:04:57,960 --> 00:04:58,760
Ms. Wen?

118
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:01,200
Oh, I forgot.

119
00:05:01,440 --> 00:05:02,570
You're really free.

120
00:05:03,500 --> 00:05:04,720
Cut the "Ms. Wen."

121
00:05:05,440 --> 00:05:06,700
Are you satisfied now?

122
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:07,960
Not really.

123
00:05:10,640 --> 00:05:12,160
What are you up to next?

124
00:05:18,710 --> 00:05:20,250
[Police Report Receipt]

125
00:05:22,960 --> 00:05:24,080
See you in court.

126
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:28,200
Why so ruthless?

127
00:05:31,640 --> 00:05:32,770
What a coincidence.

128
00:05:33,130 --> 00:05:34,159
When your mother took you

129
00:05:34,159 --> 00:05:35,760
to kneel before Shu Minghai,

130
00:05:36,840 --> 00:05:38,240
I thought the same thing.

131
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:40,360
Shu Tinglan,

132
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:43,600
like mother, like daughter.

133
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:46,200
You both self-righteously believe

134
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:47,170
in the goodness men show.

135
00:05:47,170 --> 00:05:48,320
That's why Shu Minghai

136
00:05:48,320 --> 00:05:49,650
fooled you completely.

137
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:51,080
And now,

138
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:53,010
what is the outcome?

139
00:05:55,320 --> 00:05:56,200
Probably,

140
00:05:56,640 --> 00:05:57,960
a mother and daughter loving each other

141
00:05:57,960 --> 00:06:00,220
and spending their later years in peace.

142
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:01,720
Unlike someone,

143
00:06:02,160 --> 00:06:03,580
who's busy spending a fortune

144
00:06:03,580 --> 00:06:04,910
to hire the best lawyers

145
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:06,000
so they don't

146
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,800
end up in jail later.

147
00:06:09,470 --> 00:06:10,520
Hey!

148
00:06:19,520 --> 00:06:20,920
I really don't get you.

149
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:22,440
When the situation was most favorable,

150
00:06:22,440 --> 00:06:24,360
you said Zhuoyuan Tech was also a victim.

151
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:26,400
What if they say
you staged the whole thing?

152
00:06:26,400 --> 00:06:27,200
He won't.

153
00:06:28,400 --> 00:06:30,880
What spell did Zhuo Yu'an cast on you?

154
00:06:31,520 --> 00:06:32,200
I'm just

155
00:06:32,440 --> 00:06:33,920
telling the truth.

156
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:36,960
Hello?

157
00:06:37,200 --> 00:06:37,640
Hello?

158
00:06:38,159 --> 00:06:38,680
Shu,

159
00:06:38,960 --> 00:06:39,740
still listening?

160
00:06:39,740 --> 00:06:40,800
Enough talk.

161
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:53,800
Zhuo Yu'an?

162
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:56,900
Zhuo Yu'an?

163
00:07:19,790 --> 00:07:21,050
You must be exhausted.

164
00:07:21,650 --> 00:07:22,720
Thank you.

165
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:30,280
Why didn't you go home?

166
00:07:34,180 --> 00:07:35,510
If I fall asleep at home,

167
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:37,320
I won’t get to see you.

168
00:07:41,840 --> 00:07:42,560
Let's go.

169
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:46,760
I won't go in.

170
00:07:47,470 --> 00:07:49,570
I still have things to do at the company.

171
00:07:49,570 --> 00:07:50,600
What's the matter?

172
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:51,640
Why so urgent?

173
00:07:53,300 --> 00:07:54,960
Regulators have summoned us.

174
00:07:55,560 --> 00:07:56,560
I have to be there.

175
00:07:59,520 --> 00:08:00,650
Don't overthink it.

176
00:08:01,070 --> 00:08:02,670
It has nothing to do with you.

177
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:07,420
I ordered food for you.

178
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:08,360
Don't skip it.

179
00:08:11,080 --> 00:08:11,810
I'm leaving.

180
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:18,600
Don't skip your meal either.

181
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:37,370
Mr. Zhuo.

182
00:08:37,640 --> 00:08:38,169
Mr. Zhuo.

183
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:41,020
Someone ordered food for you.

184
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,060
Who ordered it?

185
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:47,120
She said

186
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:48,720
she is Mrs. Zhuo.

187
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:07,840
Thank you, Lawyer Xiao.

188
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:08,700
You're so busy,

189
00:09:08,750 --> 00:09:10,490
yet you still made time to help me.

190
00:09:10,490 --> 00:09:11,800
No need to be so polite.

191
00:09:12,560 --> 00:09:14,040
But I never expected

192
00:09:14,140 --> 00:09:15,740
they'd defend it by claiming

193
00:09:15,800 --> 00:09:18,060
the data was implanted for experiments.

194
00:09:18,280 --> 00:09:19,100
But fortunately,

195
00:09:19,100 --> 00:09:20,120
we won the case.

196
00:09:20,640 --> 00:09:21,280
After all, we have

197
00:09:21,280 --> 00:09:22,880
the invincible Lawyer Xiao.

198
00:09:24,160 --> 00:09:24,920
Wen Jian got hit

199
00:09:24,920 --> 00:09:26,680
with administrative penalties
and a public apology.

200
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:28,340
The client is very satisfied.

201
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:30,240
I didn't expect

202
00:09:30,260 --> 00:09:31,280
you and Wen Jian

203
00:09:31,410 --> 00:09:32,940
to have such a deep history.

204
00:09:34,160 --> 00:09:35,140
Now that it's come to this,

205
00:09:35,140 --> 00:09:36,270
it's time to move on.

206
00:09:37,880 --> 00:09:38,860
I'll give you two days off

207
00:09:38,860 --> 00:09:40,040
to relax and unwind.

208
00:09:40,060 --> 00:09:40,880
Lawyer Xiao,

209
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:43,130
what about the Tingjing Finance case?

210
00:09:43,160 --> 00:09:43,890
Don't worry.

211
00:09:44,030 --> 00:09:45,630
We can spare you for two days.

212
00:09:46,400 --> 00:09:46,960
I'm off.

213
00:09:59,160 --> 00:10:00,090
Why are you here?

214
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:02,180
Zhuoyuan Tech's in such a big mess.

215
00:10:02,180 --> 00:10:03,840
Your dad wanted a talk with me.

216
00:10:04,660 --> 00:10:05,860
What did he ask about?

217
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,400
The internal situation.

218
00:10:08,880 --> 00:10:09,840
Talk properly with him.

219
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:10,600
No argument.

220
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:17,960
Look at the mess you've made.

221
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:19,680
I told you already

222
00:10:19,880 --> 00:10:22,560
to pick the right partners carefully.

223
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:24,800
But you wouldn't listen.

224
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:26,200
Also,

225
00:10:26,920 --> 00:10:28,640
your company's internal operations

226
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:30,040
are highly inefficient.

227
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:31,820
That tech company of yours

228
00:10:31,920 --> 00:10:34,320
looks like a childish setup to me.

229
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:37,130
It's good if it collapses
during this crisis.

230
00:10:37,130 --> 00:10:39,790
Come back
to my investment department already.

231
00:10:41,560 --> 00:10:42,400
Are you mute?

232
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:45,630
You were so eloquent
at the press conference.

233
00:10:45,630 --> 00:10:47,000
Talking about customer privacy

234
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:47,600
and trust.

235
00:10:48,040 --> 00:10:49,840
You're only good at talking.

236
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:50,640
Oh,

237
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:52,360
that's enough.

238
00:10:52,560 --> 00:10:53,640
Why are you yelling?

239
00:10:53,640 --> 00:10:55,200
Our son finally comes home,

240
00:10:55,220 --> 00:10:57,320
and all he hears is you shouting.

241
00:10:57,640 --> 00:10:58,960
What's the big deal?

242
00:10:59,690 --> 00:11:00,920
Why are you so angry?

243
00:11:01,680 --> 00:11:02,480
Have some tea.

244
00:11:02,800 --> 00:11:03,460
It's fresh.

245
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:05,060
I'm not in the mood.

246
00:11:05,350 --> 00:11:07,160
Fooling around like this,

247
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:09,080
he has disgraced our family.

248
00:11:10,400 --> 00:11:11,600
Drink it or not.

249
00:11:11,620 --> 00:11:13,150
I should've just dumped it.

250
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:14,680
Besides,

251
00:11:15,040 --> 00:11:16,170
whose face did we lose?

252
00:11:16,170 --> 00:11:17,360
Yours?

253
00:11:17,380 --> 00:11:19,800
Did it embarrass your old, wrinkled face?

254
00:11:20,160 --> 00:11:20,800
Honestly.

255
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:22,640
When you were Yu'an's age,

256
00:11:22,640 --> 00:11:24,500
you couldn't even speak English.

257
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:25,920
You guys talk.

258
00:11:25,920 --> 00:11:26,650
I'm leaving.

259
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:28,720
Yu'an!

260
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:29,600
Hey.

261
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:30,440
Yu'an!

262
00:11:41,400 --> 00:11:42,840
It's bitter and astringent.

263
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:43,840
Who would want it?

264
00:11:49,210 --> 00:11:49,920
Yu'an!

265
00:11:50,800 --> 00:11:51,360
Yu'an!

266
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:54,540
Don't mind your dad's nonsense.

267
00:11:54,540 --> 00:11:55,240
He’s such an old fossil.

268
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:56,240
What does he know?

269
00:11:57,380 --> 00:11:58,200
Mom,

270
00:11:58,890 --> 00:12:00,690
it really was my fault this time.

271
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:02,440
I'll be more careful.

272
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:03,330
Alright.

273
00:12:03,960 --> 00:12:05,920
Why so formal here?

274
00:12:06,320 --> 00:12:07,120
Oh, right.

275
00:12:07,240 --> 00:12:08,200
Tell me.

276
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:10,400
I heard from the girls at your company

277
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:12,340
that you're chasing someone.

278
00:12:12,930 --> 00:12:13,860
What's her name?

279
00:12:13,880 --> 00:12:14,810
What does she do?

280
00:12:15,040 --> 00:12:15,920
Do you have a picture?

281
00:12:15,920 --> 00:12:16,720
Let me see.

282
00:12:17,160 --> 00:12:17,880
Mom,

283
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:20,640
stop checking up on me, alright?

284
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:22,160
I didn't.

285
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:24,040
That's why I'm asking you.

286
00:12:27,440 --> 00:12:28,240
Alright, Mom.

287
00:12:28,520 --> 00:12:29,480
When we...

288
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:33,850
When we make some progress,

289
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:35,920
I'll tell you for sure, okay?

290
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:37,880
I really have things to do.

291
00:12:37,880 --> 00:12:38,740
I'll get going.

